@page "/"
@page "/home"

<div class="home-hero">
    <h1>CycloneDX Web Tool</h1>
    <p>A browser-based tool for working with Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) files in the CycloneDX format. Convert, validate, and merge BOMs in your browser.</p>
    <p class="hero-privacy">
        <span class="oi oi-lock-locked" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        100% client-side &mdash; your files never leave your browser
    </p>
</div>

<div class="feature-grid">
    <a href="convert" class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card-icon">
            <span class="oi oi-transfer" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <h3>Convert</h3>
        <p>Transform BOMs between JSON, XML, Protobuf, and SPDX JSON. Downgrade to any spec version.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="validate" class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card-icon">
            <span class="oi oi-check" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <h3>Validate</h3>
        <p>Check that a CycloneDX BOM file conforms to a specific specification version schema.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="merge" class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card-icon">
            <span class="oi oi-fullscreen-exit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <h3>Merge</h3>
        <p>Combine multiple CycloneDX BOM files into a single unified BOM using a flat merge.</p>
    </a>
</div>

<div class="home-formats">
    <p class="home-formats-label">Supported formats</p>
    <div class="format-tags">
        <span class="format-tag">CycloneDX JSON</span>
        <span class="format-tag">CycloneDX XML</span>
        <span class="format-tag">Protobuf</span>
        <span class="format-tag">SPDX JSON</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="home-about">
    <div class="home-about-card">
        <h3>What is CycloneDX?</h3>
        <p>CycloneDX is a lightweight SBOM standard for application security and software supply chain analysis, maintained by the OWASP Foundation.</p>
        <a href="https://cyclonedx.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cyclonedx.org &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-about-card">
        <h3>Free and open source</h3>
        <p>Built and maintained on GitHub, released under the <a href="https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-web-tool/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apache 2.0</a> license. Issues and contributions are welcome.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-web-tool/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub &rarr;</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="home-meta">
    <span class="oi oi-data-transfer-download" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p>Installs as a <strong>Progressive Web App</strong> and works offline once loaded. Press <code>Ctrl+F5</code> to pick up updates.</p>
</div>
